---
// "Get started in three steps" on the home page.
import { url } from '../lib/url';
---

<ol class="steps not-content">
	<li>
		<span class="num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
		<h3>Download arcsec</h3>
		<p>
			Unzip it and keep <code>arcsec.exe</code> in a folder of your choice. There is no installer and
			nothing else to set up.
		</p>
		<a href={url('#download')}>Downloads</a>
	</li>
	<li>
		<span class="num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
		<h3>Fetch a star catalogue</h3>
		<p>
			arcsec recognises your stars by comparing them with a catalogue. One command fetches it, for example{" "}
			<code>arcsec catalog install d50</code>.
		</p>
		<a href={url('which-catalogue/')}>Which catalogue do I need?</a>
	</li>
	<li>
		<span class="num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
		<h3>Point N.I.N.A. at it</h3>
		<p>
			In N.I.N.A.'s plate solving options, choose ASTAP and enter the path to <code>arcsec.exe</code>. Solve
			as usual.
		</p>
		<a href={url('nina/')}>Set-up guide</a>
	</li>
</ol>

<style>
	.steps {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 1rem 0 0;
		display: grid;
		gap: 1rem;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
		counter-reset: none;
	}
	li {
		position: relative;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.6rem;
		padding: 1.25rem;
		border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
		border-radius: 0.5rem;
		background: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
	}
	.num {
		display: grid;
		place-items: center;
		width: 2.25rem;
		height: 2.25rem;
		border-radius: 50%;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-lg);
		color: var(--sl-color-black);
		background: var(--sl-color-accent);
	}
	h3 {
		margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-lg);
		color: var(--sl-color-white);
	}
	p {
		margin: 0;
		flex: 1;
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
	}
	code {
		font-size: 0.9em;
	}
	a {
		font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
	}
</style>
